306
00:15:21,280 --> 00:15:22,600
There a large West shirt in there?

307
00:15:22,940 --> 00:15:23,880
Sure is.

308
00:15:24,220 --> 00:15:26,580
Shouldn't you be helping me since you're also on the committee?

309
00:15:27,400 --> 00:15:28,740
I want my shirt too.

310
00:15:29,000 --> 00:15:30,100
Got any East smalls?

311
00:15:30,100 --> 00:15:33,220
Yoshikawa, where are the West mediums?

312
00:15:33,280 --> 00:15:33,820
Oh, yeah.

313
00:15:33,940 --> 00:15:35,200
And can I get a West small?

314
00:15:36,160 --> 00:15:37,360
