I went with the hundred meter dash.

319
00:15:49,360 --> 00:15:50,660
You could always join the relay.

320
00:15:51,240 --> 00:15:51,640
What?

321
00:15:52,280 --> 00:15:53,600
No, that's too much pressure.

322
00:15:54,040 --> 00:15:55,900
Members of the track team compete in that one.

323
