379
00:18:26,360 --> 00:18:27,440
Does he get like that, too?

380
00:18:27,880 --> 00:18:28,740
Oh, Miyamura.

381
00:18:30,460 --> 00:18:31,460
Um...

382
00:18:38,180 --> 00:18:39,120
It's fine.

383
