For both of you.

387
00:18:48,500 --> 00:18:49,740
Guess the gang's all here.

388
00:18:50,000 --> 00:18:51,360
Almost through with painting, Yoshikawa?

389
00:18:51,660 --> 00:18:52,780
Yeah, just about.

390
00:18:53,420 --> 00:18:54,620
Good. Hear the announcement?

391
00:18:54,620 --> 00:18:57,700
