394
00:19:03,260 --> 00:19:04,520
I can do this for you.

395
00:19:04,920 --> 00:19:05,960
Aw, you...

396
00:19:05,960 --> 00:19:08,880
What grade did you manage to pull in our class?

397
00:19:09,080 --> 00:19:12,200
Look, that's not relevant, so just get going and leave this to me.

398
00:19:12,200 --> 00:19:14,960
Thank you, Hori.

399
00:19:15,360 --> 00:19:17,120
I'll hurry right back after, okay?

400
00:19:17,420 --> 00:19:17,680
Mm-hmm.

401
00:19:19,920 --> 00:19:22,340
All I have to do is stay inside the lines.

402
00:19:22,780 --> 00:19:23,520
Easy enough.

403
00:19:24,160 --> 00:19:26,160
Don't need an A in art to do this, Yuki.

404
00:19:27,660 --> 00:19:28,180
Achoo!

405
00:19:28,180 --> 00:19:32,340
I wish I thought to wear my blazer today.

406
00:19:32,980 --> 00:19:33,520
I bet.

407
00:19:33,920 --> 00:19:35,660
This fall weather has been pretty chilly.

408
00:19:36,660 --> 00:19:37,180
Mizuuchi.

409
00:19:37,940 --> 00:19:38,860
You're so lucky.

410
00:19:39,760 --> 00:19:42,160
