And no, I'm not done.

421
00:20:08,220 --> 00:20:13,320
Who's is that?

422
00:20:14,560 --> 00:20:15,160
Mizuuchi's?

423
00:20:15,740 --> 00:20:18,840
I said I'd kill for some pants, and...

424
00:20:18,840 --> 00:20:19,760
He gave me this.

425
00:20:19,760 --> 00:20:20,760
Uh...

426
00:20:20,760 --> 00:20:21,760
Uh...

427
00:20:21,760 --> 00:20:22,760
Uh...

428
00:20:22,760 --> 00:20:42,340
It's warmer than the blazer.

429
00:20:43,340 --> 00:20:46,520
Yeah, well, I have been wearing it, so that makes sense.

430
00:20:48,620 --> 00:20:49,380
Thank you.

431
00:20:49,380 --> 00:20:55,540
How is he gonna know?

432
00:20:55,800 --> 00:20:56,820
I guess that's true.

433
00:20:58,020 --> 00:20:59,700
You wanna give me a hand?

434
00:21:01,020 --> 00:21:03,220
Don't think I've ever painted like this before.

435
00:21:04,320 --> 00:21:06,780
Oh, but you went outside the line here.

436
00:21:06,780 --> 00:21:07,340
Uh...

437
00:21:07,340 --> 00:21:08,780
Achoo!

438
00:21:12,780 --> 00:21:13,780
Uh...

439
00:21:13,780 --> 00:21:17,780
Uh...

440
00:21:17,780 --> 00:21:20,920
Hori.

441
00:21:22,200 --> 00:21:23,180
You warm?

442
00:21:23,900 --> 00:21:24,780
Yeah, thanks.

443
00:21:25,440 --> 00:21:26,400
This really helped.

444
00:21:27,300 --> 00:21:28,360
Sure you're not cold?

445
00:21:28,800 --> 00:21:29,040
Mm-hmm.

446
00:21:30,100 --> 00:21:32,620
If you need something else, let me know.

447
00:21:33,580 --> 00:21:34,200
Uh...

448
00:21:34,200 --> 00:21:37,580
Yeah, that's right.

449
00:21:38,360 --> 00:21:41,200
Strut away in the exact opposite direction from Hori.

450
00:21:41,920 --> 00:21:45,200
Completely oblivious that it's my body heat you're feeling now.

451
00:21:45,200 --> 00:21:47,200
Honestly...

452
00:21:47,940 --> 00:21:50,740
Are you jealous?

453
00:21:52,080 --> 00:21:53,280
You really are!

454
00:21:53,280 --> 00:21:53,340
You really are!

455
00:22:01,340 --> 00:22:02,980
You can stop anytime, Giggles.

456
00:22:04,620 --> 00:22:04,980
Huh.

457
00:22:04,980 --> 00:22:06,880
I just saw her drape it over her legs.

458
00:22:07,040 --> 00:22:09,460
But for some reason, the sleeves feel nice and warm, too.

459
00:22:09,460 --> 00:22:10,320
Yeah.

460
00:22:10,440 --> 00:22:11,600
tee has a form of one more.

461
00:22:11,600 --> 00:22:12,200
Wow.

462
00:22:12,200 --> 00:22:12,560
I love it.

463
00:22:12,560 --> 00:22:12,620
Yeah.

464
00:22:12,800 --> 00:22:14,120
Mm-hmm.

465
00:22:14,120 --> 00:22:14,800
Thank you for being here.

466
00:22:14,940 --> 00:22:17,220
